       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-SPATIAL-ANCHOR.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SPATIAL-ANCHOR-PROOFS.
           05  WS-PROXIMITY-SEMANTIC-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CLUSTER-COHESION-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PREPROMPT-SYNTHESIS-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPATIAL-REORG-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPATIAL-ANCHOR-SEAL-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SPATIAL-ANCHOR-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-ANCHOR-PROVEN        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-ANCHOR-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PROXIMITY-AND-CLUSTER.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SYNTHESIS-AND-REORG.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-ANCHOR-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PROXIMITY-AND-CLUSTER.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PROXIMITY-SEMANTIC-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CLUSTER-COHESION-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-SYNTHESIS-AND-REORG.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PREPROMPT-SYNTHESIS-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SPATIAL-REORG-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-ANCHOR-PROOFS.
           IF WS-PROXIMITY-SEMANTIC-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CLUSTER-COHESION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PREPROMPT-SYNTHESIS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SPATIAL-REORG-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SPATIAL-ANCHOR-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-ANCHOR-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-ANCHOR-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-ANCHOR-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-ANCHOR-CODE.
